SUMMARY:Field Science: Pollinator Edition
DESCRIPTION:All programs at Prairie Ridge currently require registration.  Register\n\n\n\n\nDid you know that bees and butterflies are only part of the pollinator story? Discover the hidden heroes of our ecosystem through collaborative science with The Great Sunflower Project. This hands-on science project teaches you how to identify\, observe\, and record data on our local pollinators to support real-world scientific research. We will also take a sweep at capturing bugs to observe with nets to document on iNaturalist!
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/field-science-pollinator-edition/
LOCATION:Prairie Ridge\, 1671 Gold Star Drive\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27607\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Children,Collaborative Science,Educators,K-12 Students,Outdoor Experiences,Teens
ORGANIZER;CN="Julie%20Hall":MAILTO:julie.hall@naturalsciences.org
