SUMMARY:Coffee & Collections: Insect Lab and Ornithology Tour (Brimley Society Exclusive)
DESCRIPTION:This event is reserved for Brimley Society Members. Not a Brimley? Join or Upgrade today and unlock additional premium events! \nJoin us on an exclusive behind-the-science talk and tour of our Insect Research Lab (known as the “Ant Lab” on YouTube) and Ornithology collections! This event will be led by our resident Bug and Bird Experts… \n                                \n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n        Dr. Adrian Smith                                          Dr. Brian O’Shea                                            John Gerwin\n           Research Head                                          Collections Manager                                     Research Curator\n       Insect Research Lab                                           Ornithology                                                   Ornithology\n\n                                                                                                                                                                                                                    Coffee and light refreshments will be provided. RSVP to the organizer below.
URL:https://www.naturalsciences.org/calendar/event/coffee-collections-insect-lab-and-ornithology-tour-brimley-society-exclusive/
LOCATION:Downtown Raleigh\, 11 West Jones Street\, Raleigh\, NC\, 27601\, United States
CATEGORIES:Adults,Brimley Exclusive,Member Exclusive
